content.text:
I found and saved the endpoint. The endpoint that **commits** an alert acknowledgement (POST write operation) is `/v3/alerts/{id}/ack`, while `/v3/alerts/{id}` is the GET endpoint that only reads ack state.

```json
{
  "commit_endpoint_path": "/v3/alerts/{id}/ack"
}
```
